{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:00 2026-10-02 HKT</p>\n\n<p>36歲的TVB花旦陳瀅近日在社交平台大派福利，帶同愛犬前往沙灘享受日光浴，並寫道：「beach days with the boys」。相中陳瀅頭戴卡其色鴨舌帽與墨鏡，身穿一件啡色貼身一件頭泳衣，下身搭配超短牛仔熱褲，晒出一雙白滑修長美腿及緊緻纖腰，明顯是修身成功，展示惹火身材，泳裝的大露背剪裁更讓她的白滑玉背一覽無遺，散發出極致健康性感，瞬間電暈一眾網民。</p>\n<h2>陳瀅惹火泳裝放狗春色無邊</h2>\n<p>陳瀅今次沙灘出巡，主要是帶兩隻愛犬曬太陽，她出動編織袋將臘腸狗「袋住走」，狗狗顯得十分聽話，另一隻白色芝娃娃亦在沙灘帳篷下盡情放風，畫面溫馨治癒。不過最吸引網民，莫過於陳瀅雙膝跪在沙灘墊上，俯身玩狗一幕，上圍呼之欲出，險些在鏡頭前洩春光，這組邪惡視角令網民紛紛狂讚：「身材真係無得頂」、「極度誘惑」。</p>\n<img alt=\"周嘉洛與陳瀅戲假情真，但早前周嘉洛將陳瀅降呢成「少見的朋友」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a42f6e4751f866c5abf36753c3fda244/2023-01/%E7%97%9E%E5%AD%90%E6%AE%BF%E4%B8%8B%20%E5%91%A8%E5%98%89%E6%B4%9B%20%286%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"周嘉洛之前孖住陳瀅拍節目《約埋班Friend去旅行》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f6f6f0465395a79277ad5f6d2f20c1d/2023-09/kalok__358473061_18360855601065923_4267225134648396023_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅跪在沙灘墊上「烏低身」照顧愛犬，惹火身材呼之欲出，險洩春光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1644a851f248ca4d9e8b56f3ba6a071e/2026-10/SaveClip_App_827831006_18630171514033728_2896456897316946891_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅將毛孩裝進編織袋中「袋住走」，並身穿貼身泳衣大晒纖腰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ebc4c772f6e4a9cdc4c75b8fa9e83416/2026-10/SaveClip_App_827857001_18630171499033728_7246752403876051225_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅以泳衣搭配超短牛仔熱褲現身海灘，展示健康性感魅力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5290958184e398624ad1fb43c4d6957/2026-10/SaveClip_App_830572770_18630171487033728_7704186794100757759_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅曾公開叫Howie做老公。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/359dc7731fdda9aae8cf6b80e59d5b93/2022-11/y24.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅曾稱對方做「老公」，而Howie仲送花兼嗌對方做「老婆」。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2324ecf39c2a329a901e5a64411087be/2022-11/y25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅多次強調二人份屬好友關係！  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2ae5d8afd3026378b6542408887e55f5/2022-11/y26.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅疑似撐枱腳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31fed1a091c9188ab3671a74ff709f58/2024-09/JEANNIE_66_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅曾因為易胖體質，飽受網民批評。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c156eb5c421e451697224fb268e77304/2022-12/JEA84.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅擁有好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/439baf4e6fc770d1ccb1d8ab6e5f46db/2022-12/JEA86.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅好Fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f86783053ac2813d66fbadf9c0516a6/2022-12/JEA87.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅有不少泳款都大露背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25db25e86b22ae5428ba01f1c36a7ee4/2023-08/VideoScreenshot--JEANNIEmissjniInstagramphotosandvideos-0_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅早前更新IG，以英文寫道「這是一個開心的9月」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/431fd5ed16d05030623adb59a280d336/2025-10/1_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅身材越來越Fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88fc415f74768574d55162b59b7ba33c/2025-10/2_11_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅穿幼帶比堅尼盡騷一流身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b27980463d68f85bb1f568e00328e28/2025-10/3_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅曾帶愛犬到海灘。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1cec19cdc2b29b0117edb08fa3f8c5d5/2023-01/jin31.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅2024年慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f7c4c55dc30fa6596569bcbfdd7b579d/2024-10/508.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅在日落下拍照留念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a49efe290654ef0012ff1e90878132a/2024-10/509.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅與多位好友在遊艇上影合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42fc0f7dacab2c6d181c1bebb7c85323/2024-10/506.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅與多位好友在遊艇上影合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a6db8f55785ea43537d1ae908fd0261/2024-10/505.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"壽星女的陳瀅，身穿白色三點式外披一件紅色心心開胸長衣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/96c8d95aa6c82e12d0c79ee7e42f78fd/2024-10/502_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曉華、朱敏瀚及王菲、張子丰，兩pair戀人刻意分開企。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d21a49fddb2f1632d77de2d13316e79/2024-10/601_3.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅近來愛以真空打扮上陣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc65de0d04d1f2ff6dff756814961805/2025-02/JEANNIE_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅瘦身後鍾意晒玉背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47b0553afb63b789c4f83829b825b985/2025-02/JEANNIE_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅早前出席沙田馬場的「TVB賽馬日」，穿上通花設計的白裙，看起來若隱若現。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9df325e8d539d1a13eeebc4be90ce37a/2025-02/JEANNIE_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅轉身有睇頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba04e4d339ee27b309ea50489f70fb7f/2025-02/JEANNIE_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅疑似真空上陣，側身險走光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ec782952c0e217d8401ebb59f3cff69/2025-02/JEANNIE_5_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>周嘉洛現身點讚附送心心眼</h2>\n<p>陳瀅的惹火沙灘相曝光後，與她傳足多年緋聞的周嘉洛，亦第一時間現身，完全不避嫌高調留下：「the boys！」及心心眼的表情符號，似乎對陳瀅的泳照與可愛狗狗相當受落。雖然兩人早前澄清只是「好朋友」關係，但如今周嘉洛依然緊貼女方社交動態，更公開隔空傳情，令兩人撲朔迷離的緋聞再次引發聯想。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅身材好誘人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a464b3cd6ca933a1b784555309e7726/2023-04/unknown_306625565_772863237126090_7218071822818294894_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅未有公開感情生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/154d5ac15253ca82d70a0721ad01327d/2024-09/JEANNIE_65_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅擁有逆天長腿，不時大派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7ef58049d8059bde83597117b149b851/2026-05/IMG_9868.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅入行數年已經成為TVB一線花旦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8be4741efd1b368d00629c28d9ade86e/2023-01/jin51.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅的比堅尼泳衣，包不住她的豐滿上圍，非常性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f821fd4b7b4a3153f1171853a5919d25/2026-06/3928686747325740919_801727.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅在吊床上曬日光浴，甚識享受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/191e7efae07c011d9497156212544006/2026-06/3928686774395810063_801727.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅在泳池嬉水，背影相當誘惑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95c4c4af83a75dac4be4518539203db7/2026-06/3928686813906077064_801727.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅回頭展示甜美笑容，俘虜不少網民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ab098461d753c92b87871f8ff6279dc/2026-06/3928686820432482918_801727.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅的居家Look，是網民近期喜愛的打扮之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c222ee69764a0b95024b36402e3c4bb6/2022-12/JEA83.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅的社交網有不少泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ee48fbfdaa6815449cf1a8a4043b764/2022-12/JEA79.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅不時派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/04e811f92b0da6dd4eae5ae23334457b/2023-06/JC006%20%282%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅大晒三點式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e416db7bc8ac5c412308d76a154cb14e/2022-12/JEA81.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅越來越Fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e359bc498dcc8b9dfe292bbd86561858/2024-07/missjni_1722149756_3421962639150770001_801727.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅於IG上載性感靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/767cf4d7566efa858612f11c7d1bb9f7/2026-01/1_10_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅穿上低胸閃銀晚裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83bd7939f0f68a3d05630c06168510c3/2026-01/2_9_24.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅穿上黑絲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a82c89c542171f153f6001955a5c20b0/2026-01/3_55.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅展現高貴性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28f2d84b8f5e370049927ca28d72e7fb/2026-01/4_0_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅眼神嫵媚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd2e33fd47e69b0abec5e04aee9a8d22/2026-01/tt1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅渾身散發女人味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32426e3af8989c2eb63ebcd201319c7c/2026-01/TT3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅身材極佳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea2abe4fb4cfcbeee4724419006b192c/2026-01/TT4.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T08:20:47.804469+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":526,"images":48,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}